      "qualification": "Four actual i686/s390x strict-provenance Miri executions run borrowed payload, full-tail validation, u64 overflow and 32769-block >4GiB arithmetic tests in safe/all modes. Exact copied production scan/cursor/frame/error modules also compile and emit concrete ARM objects with core only, without alloc; emitted query IR has no rust allocation entrypoint. This standalone component proves no allocation dependency in structural queries, not full-crate core-only support. Foreign evidence is interpretation/code generation, not hardware execution."
